    "text": "When 2 litre of ideal gas expands isothermally into vacuum to a total volume of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math> litre, the change in internal energy is _____&nbsp;J. (Nearest integer)",
